.839">neighbors </span><span begin="00:15.839" end="00:16.109">think </span><span begin="00:16.109" end="00:16.259">I'm </span><span begin="00:16.259" end="00:17.469">crazy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.779" end="00:20.409"><span begin="00:17.779" end="00:17.939">But </span><span begin="00:17.939" end="00:18.099">they </span><span begin="00:18.099" end="00:18.489">don't </span><span begin="00:18.489" end="00:20.409">understand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.879" end="00:22.909"><span begin="00:20.879" end="00:21.049">You're </span><span begin="00:21.049" end="00:21.579">all </span><span begin="00:21.579" end="00:21.769">I </span><span begin="00:21.769" end="00:22.909">had</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.139" end="00:26.668"><span begin="00:24.139" end="00:24.299">You're </span><span begin="00:24.299" end="00:24.799">all </span><span begin="00:24.799" end="00:25.049">I </span><span begin="00:25.049" end="00:26.668">had</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.908" end="00:34.848"><span begin="00:28.908" end="00:29.198">At </span><span begin="00:29.198" end="00:29.618">night </span><span begin="00:29.618" end="00:30.088">when </span><span begin="00:30.088" end="00:30.478">the </span><span begin="00:30.478" end="00:31.448">stars </span><span begin="00:31.448" end="00:32.138">light </span><span begin="00:32.138" end="00:32.828">up </span><span begin="00:32.828" end="00:33.658">my </span><span begin="00:33.658" end="00:34.848">room</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.308" end="00:45.395"><span begin="00:35.308" end="00:35.698">I </span><span begin="00:35.698" end="00:36.108">sit </span><span begin="00:36.108" end="00:36.498">by </span><span begin="00:36.498" end="00:39.138">myself </span><span begin="00:39.138" end="00:39.738">talking </span><span begin="00:39.738" end="00:40.148">to </span><span begin="00:40.148" end="00:40.538">the </span><span begin="00:40.538" end="00:45.395">moon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.395" end="00:51.827"><span begin="00:45.395" end="00:46.115">Tryna </span><span begin="00:46.115" end="00:46.405">get </span><span begin="00:46.405" end="00:46.865">to </span><span begin="00:46.865" end="00:51.827">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.258" end="00:58.947"><span begin="00:53.258" end="00:53.488">In </span><span begin="00:53.488" end="00:53.978">hopes </span><span begin="00:53.978" end="00:54.188">you're </span><span begin="00:54.188" end="00:54.818">on </span><span begin="00:54.818" end="00:55.028">the </span><span begin="00:55.028" end="00:55.398">other </span><span begin="00:55.398" end="00:56.808">side </span><span begin="00:56.808" end="00:57.397">talking </span><span begin="00:57.397" end="00:57.807">to </span><span begin="00:57.807" end="00:58.277">me </span><span begin="00:58.277" end="00:58.947">too</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.087" end="01:07.846"><span begin="00:59.087" end="00:59.287">Or </span><span begin="00:59.287" end="00:59.527">am </span><span begin="00:59.527" end="00:59.807">I </span><span begin="00:59.807" end="01:00.107">a </span><span begin="01:00.107" end="01:02.346">fool </span><span begin="01:02.346" end="01:02.526">who </span><span begin="01:02.526" end="01:02.926">sits </span><span begin="01:02.926" end="01:04.926">alone </span><span begin="01:04.926" end="01:05.506">talking </span><span begin="01:05.506" end="01:06.006">to </span><span begin="01:06.006" end="01:06.196">the </span><span begin="01:06.196" end="01:07.846">moon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.236" end="01:12.346"><span begin="01:09.236" end="01:12.346">Oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.676" end="01:15.985"><span begin="01:13.676" end="01:13.816">I'm </span><span begin="01:13.816" end="01:14.246">feeling </span><span begin="01:14.246" end="01:14.406">like </span><span begin="01:14.406" end="01:14.656">I'm </span><span begin="01:14.656" end="01:15.985">famous</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.195" end="01:18.753"><span begin="01:16.195" end="01:16.335">The </span><span begin="01:16.335" end="01:16.934">talk </span><span begin="01:16.934" end="01:17.354">of </span><span begin="01:17.354" end="01:17.504">the </span><span begin="01:17.504" end="01:18.753">town</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.013" end="01:21.223"><span begin="01:19.013" end="01:19.163">They </span><span begin="01:19.163" end="01:19.563">say </span><span begin="01:19.563" end="01:20.013">I've </span><span begin="01:20.013" end="01:20.373">gone </span><span begin="01:20.373" end="01:21.223">mad</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.573" end="01:24.812"><span begin="01:22.573" end="01:22.743">Yeah, </span><span begin="01:22.743" end="01:23.243">I've </span><span begin="01:23.243" end="01:23.643">gone </span><span begin="01:23.643" end="01:24.812">mad</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.712" end="01:28.831"><span begin="01:26.712" end="01:26.872">But </span><span begin="01:26.872" end="01:27.062">they </span><span begin="01:27.062" end="01:27.282">don't </span><span begin="01:27.282" end="01:27.462">know </span><span begin="01:27.462" end="01:27.662">what </span><span begin="01:27.662" end="01:28.072">I </span><span begin="01:28.072" end="01:28.831">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.141" end="01:31.950"><span begin="01:29.141" end="01:29.301">'Cause </span><span begin="01:29.301" end="01:29.551">when </span><span begin="01:29.551" end="01:29.901">the </span><span begin="01:29.901" end="01:30.311">sun </span><span begin="01:30.311" end="01:30.741">goes </span><span begin="01:30.741" end="01:31.950">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.070" end="01:34.160"><span begin="01:32.070" end="01:32.590">Someone's </span><span begin="01:32.590" end="01:33.190">talking </span><span begin="01:33.190" end="01:34.160">back</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.260" end="01:37.880"><span begin="01:35.260" end="01:35.480">Yeah, </span><span begin="01:35.480" end="01:35.710">they're </span><span begin="01:35.710" end="01:36.430">talking </span><span begin="01:36.430" end="01:37.880">back</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.390" end="01:39.169"><span begin="01:38.390" end="01:39.169">Oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.239" end="01:46.109"><span begin="01:40.239" end="01:40.629">At </span><span begin="01:40.629" end="01:41.039">night </span><span begin="01:41.039" end="01:41.449">when </span><span begin="01:41.449" end="01:41.849">the </span><span begin="01:41.849" end="01:42.679">stars </span><span begin="01:42.679" end="01:43.469">light </span><span begin="01:43.469" end="01:44.279">up </span><span begin="01:44.279" end="01:45.049">my </span><span begin="01:45.049" end="01:46.109">room</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.769" end="01:56.559"><span begin="01:46.769" end="01:47.139">I </span><span begin="01:47.139" end="01:47.539">sit </span><span begin="01:47.539" end="01:47.889">by </span><span begin="01:47.889" end="01:50.389">myself </span><span begin="01:50.389" end="01:51.179">talking </span><span begin="01:51.179" end="01:51.559">to </span><span begin="01:51.559" end="01:52.009">the </span><span begin="01:52.009" end="01:56.559">moon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.833" end="02:02.942"><span begin="01:56.833" end="01:57.559">Tryna </span><span begin="01:57.559" end="01:57.893">get </span><span begin="01:57.893" end="01:58.303">to </span><span begin="01:58.303" end="02:02.942">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.698" end="02:10.317"><span begin="02:04.698" end="02:04.868">In </span><span begin="02:04.868" end="02:05.438">hopes </span><span begin="02:05.438" end="02:05.938">you're </span><span begin="02:05.938" end="02:06.358">on </span><span begin="02:06.358" end="02:06.628">the </span><span begin="02:06.628" end="02:06.908">other </span><span begin="02:06.908" end="02:08.298">side </span><span begin="02:08.298" end="02:08.968">talking </span><span begin="02:08.968" end="02:09.358">to </span><span begin="02:09.358" end="02:09.6