" end="02:41.966">night </span><span begin="02:41.966" end="02:42.376">I'm </span><span begin="02:42.376" end="02:43.196">talking </span><span begin="02:43.196" end="02:43.616">to </span><span begin="02:43.616" end="02:44.006">the </span><span begin="02:44.006" end="02:48.534">moon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.534" end="02:55.185"><span begin="02:48.534" end="02:48.722">Still </span><span begin="02:48.722" end="02:49.387">tryna </span><span begin="02:49.387" end="02:49.579">get </span><span begin="02:49.579" end="02:50.195">to </span><span begin="02:50.195" end="02:55.185">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:56.676" end="03:02.165"><span begin="02:56.676" end="02:56.906">In </span><span begin="02:56.906" end="02:57.376">hopes </span><span begin="02:57.376" end="02:57.656">you're </span><span begin="02:57.656" end="02:58.216">on </span><span begin="02:58.216" end="02:58.556">the </span><span begin="02:58.556" end="02:58.816">other </span><span begin="02:58.816" end="03:00.236">side </span><span begin="03:00.236" end="03:00.876">talking </span><span begin="03:00.876" end="03:01.326">to </span><span begin="03:01.326" end="03:01.616">me </span><span begin="03:01.616" end="03:02.165">too</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.335" end="03:11.513"><span begin="03:02.335" end="03:02.695">Or </span><span begin="03:02.695" end="03:03.065">am </span><span begin="03:03.065" end="03:03.285">I </span><span begin="03:03.285" end="03:03.475">a </span><span begin="03:03.475" end="03:05.815">fool </span><span begin="03:05.815" end="03:05.955">who </span><span begin="03:05.955" end="03:06.375">sits </span><span begin="03:06.375" end="03:08.355">alone </span><span begin="03:08.355" end="03:08.914">talking </span><span begin="03:08.914" end="03:09.414">to </span><span begin="03:09.414" end="03:09.614">the </span><span begin="03:09.614" end="03:11.513">moon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.703" end="03:15.933"><span begin="03:12.703" end="03:15.933">Oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:17.093" end="03:19.663"><span begin="03:17.093" end="03:17.273">I </span><span begin="03:17.273" end="03:17.543">know </span><span begin="03:17.543" end="03:17.723">you're </span><span begin="03:17.723" end="03:18.163">somewhere </span><span begin="03:18.163" end="03:18.623">out </span><span begin="03:18.623" end="03:19.663">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.233" end="03:24.663"><span begin="03:20.233" end="03:21.113">Somewhere </span><span begin="03:21.113" end="03:22.083">far </span><span begin="03:22.083" end="03:24.663">away</span></p></div></body></tt>